<title>USA: Devcon Intl Inc Q1 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Devcon Intl Inc Q1 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD BEACH, Fla. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			  1996</p>
<p> Shr	loss	  $	 0.26 profit  $	 0.14</p>
<p> Net	loss		   1,205 profit	     668</p>
<p> Revs			     15,450		   18,221</p>
<p> Avg shrs			  4,589		    4,659</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company said revenues of its construction contracting division were down in the first quarter. Revenues on materials businesses were flat with a year ago, but changes in product mix sold had some adverse effects on margins and operating results.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
